<h4>(2) Coriolis effect: deflection of moving objects (Foucault's "right-hand" rule)</h4>
<p>Horizontal motion ke liye, hum coordinates local karte hain: <em>East (E), North (N), Up (U)</em>. Earth ki angular velocity ke components hote hain:</p>
<div class="eq">Ï‰<sub>N</sub> = Ï‰ cos Î», &nbsp;&nbsp; Ï‰<sub>U</sub> = Ï‰ sin Î», &nbsp;&nbsp; Ï‰<sub>E</sub> = 0</div>
