<h4>(3) Freely falling body â€” eastward deflection</h4>
<p>Ye ek classic textbook problem hai (aur exam mein aksar aata hai). Ek body height <span class="m">h</span> se girti hai. Vertical velocity <span class="m">v<sub>U</sub> = âˆ’gt</span> (neeche ki taraf). Coriolis force ka east component nikalo:</p>
