  <li>Time substitute karo <span class="m">t = âˆš(2h/g)</span>:
    <div class="eq" style="margin:8px 0">x = <span class="frac"><span>1</span><span>3</span></span> Ï‰ cos Î» <span class="sqrt">(8hÂ³/g)</span> &nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="up">(eastward, both hemispheres)</span></div>
