  <p>Ek shell <span class="m">v = 500 m/s</span> ki average horizontal speed se <span class="m">L = 20 km</span> door maara jaata hai, latitude <span class="m">Î» = 45Â°</span> par. Coriolis deflection ka estimate do.</p>
