  <p><span class="m">x = Â½ a tÂ² = Â½ Ã— 5.2Ã—10â»Â² Ã— 1600 â‰ˆ 41 m</span> â€” <strong>right ki taraf</strong> (N hemisphere).</p>
  <p class="small" style="margin-bottom:0">Note: ye ek simplified estimate hai (constant horizontal speed, flat trajectory maan kar). Real ballistics mein vertical motion aur variation ki wajah se value thodi different hoti hai. Exam mein aise assumptions likh dena hamesha achha lagta hai.</p>
