<div class="box fact">
  <p class="bt">Historical fact (verified)</p>
  <p>Foucault ne 1851 mein Paris ke <strong>PanthÃ©on</strong> mein apni famous demonstration ki: <strong>67 m lamba wire aur â‰ˆ 28 kg ka brass bob</strong>. Observation: plane har ghante â‰ˆ <strong>11Â°</strong> ghoomta tha (Paris latitude 48.9Â° ke liye <span class="m">15Â° Ã— sin 48.9Â° â‰ˆ 11.3Â°/h</span> â€” theory se match!). Isse pehle 1851 mein hi unke chhote cellar experiment se idea verify hua tha. Aaj bhi duniya bhar ke museums aur physics departments mein Foucault pendulums hain, aur <em>South Pole</em> par laga pendulum lagbhag 24 ghante mein poora ek chakkar pura karta hai.</p>
  <p class="small" style="margin-bottom:0">Ek aham baat: Foucault pendulum ke liye <em>lamba</em> pendulum chahiye â€” kyunki precession rate chhoti hoti hai aur chhota pendulum damping se pehle poora pattern dika nahi paata.</p>
