  </ul>
</div>

<div class="box exam">
  <p class="bt">Exam corner â€” Chapter 3</p>
  <p><strong>Short answer:</strong></p>
  <ol>
    <li>Conservative aur non-conservative force ki definitions dijiye aur do-do examples likhiye.</li>
