    <li>Ek rectangular lamina ke liye <span class="m"><span class="vec">L</span> âˆ¦ <span class="vec">Ï‰</span></span> wala case numerically solve karke dikhaiye ki bearing par torque <span class="m">Ï„ = Ï‰Â²sinÎ¸cosÎ¸(Iâ‚ âˆ’ Iâ‚‚)</span> lagta hai.</li>
  </ol>
