<h3 id="s1-3">1.3 Z<sub>eff</sub> kaise nikalein â€” concept (na ki ratta)</h3>
<p>S ka exact value quantum mechanics se aata hai, lekin Slater ne 1930 mein ek <strong>bahut kaam ka approximate method</strong> diya jo exam mein poochha jaata hai. Idea simple hai: har type ke electron ko ek "score" do, jitna wo screen karta hai, aur sab jod do.</p>

