<tr><td>Top â†’ bottom (group mein)</td><td>Thoda badhta hai, phir constant (ns electron ke liye ~2.2)</td><td>Z bhi badhta hai, S bhi badhta hai â€” dono lagbhag cancel. Lekin n badhne se electron door chala jaata hai.</td></tr>
