<div class="box recap">
  <p class="bt">Quick Recap â€” Chapter 4</p>
  <ul style="margin-bottom:0">
    <li><span class="m">X(g) + eâ» â†’ Xâ»(g)</span>; favourable hone par Î”<sub>eg</sub>H negative, EA = âˆ’Î”<sub>eg</sub>H (positive number).</li>
    <li>Values: F âˆ’328, Cl âˆ’349, Br âˆ’325, I âˆ’295; O âˆ’141, S âˆ’200, Se âˆ’195; H âˆ’73; C âˆ’122; N â‰ˆ 0; Be/noble gases positive.</li>
    <li>Trend: period mein zyada favourable, group mein kam favourable; <strong>F anomaly</strong> (chhota size â†’ repulsion).</li>
