    <li><strong>Bond angle/geometry:</strong> VSEPR mein lone pairs "electronegative" hote hain â€” isliye NHâ‚ƒ ka angle 107Â°, Hâ‚‚O 104.5Â°.</li>
    <li><strong>Diamond vs graphite:</strong> spÂ³ carbon vs spÂ² carbon ki EN alag hai â€” graphite chemically zyada reactive (dry cell/electrode mein active).</li>
  </ul>
