  <li>Group mein neeche jaate hue <strong>metallic character badhta</strong> hai (C non-metal â†’ Si metalloid â†’ Ge, Sn, Pb metals).</li>
  <li><strong>Inert pair effect</strong> bhaari p-block elements mein: <span class="m">nsÂ²</span> electrons pair mein "inert" ho jaate hain, isliye lower oxidation state stable ho jaata hai â€” jaise Tlâº &gt; TlÂ³âº, PbÂ²âº &gt; Pbâ´âº, BiÂ³âº &gt; Biâµâº. Reason: <span class="m">nsÂ²</span> electrons nucleus ke paas zyada tightly bound (relative relativistic effects bhi), aur unko nikalne ki enthalpy bahut zyada ho jaati hai.</li>
