<tr><td>From BFâ‚ƒ + NaBHâ‚„</td><td>3NaBHâ‚„ + 4BFâ‚ƒ âŸ¶ 2Bâ‚‚Hâ‚† + 3NaBFâ‚„</td><td>Industrial-type route (BFâ‚ƒ se borane milta hai)</td></tr>
