<h4>(b) Properties</h4>
<ul>
  <li>Colourless, <strong>highly toxic</strong> gas; boiling point â‰ˆ âˆ’92 Â°C; <strong>spontaneously flammable in air</strong> (pyrophoric) aur <strong>green flame</strong> ke saath jalta hai (boron ki characteristic flame) â†’ Bâ‚‚Oâ‚ƒ banta hai.</li>
  <li>Planar (D<sub>2h</sub> symmetry), non-polar molecule (dipole moment zero).</li>
  <li>Electron-deficient hone ki wajah se ye ek <strong>Lewis acid</strong> hai â€” electron-donor (Lewis base) molecules se adduct banata hai.</li>
