<div class="box fact">
  <p class="bt">Did you know? â€” carbides kaam kahan aate hain</p>
  <ul style="margin-bottom:0">
    <li><strong>CaCâ‚‚ (calcium carbide):</strong> purani "carbide lamps" mein acetylene bana kar roshni deta tha; aaj acetylene gas aur chemicals ke liye important feedstock hai. (Aur haan â€” <em>artificial fruit ripening</em> ke liye carbide ka misuse hota hai, jo unsafe hai kyunki usmein impurities se phosphine (PHâ‚ƒ) bhi banta hai.)</li>
    <li><strong>SiC (carborundum):</strong> sandpaper, grinding wheels, high-temperature furnace linings; ab power electronics (SiC MOSFETs) mein bhi.</li>
    <li><strong>WC (tungsten carbide):</strong> cutting tools aur drill bits ("carbide tips"), jewellery-type hardness use.</li>
    <li><strong>Feâ‚ƒC (cementite):</strong> steel ki hardness/microstructure ka important phase â€” steel ki heat treatment isi ki wajah se kaam karti hai.</li>
