<tr><td><strong>General method</strong></td><td>Direct combination of the elements in appropriate ratio (temperature/pressure control karke): e.g., <span class="m">Clâ‚‚ + Fâ‚‚ â†’ 2ClF</span> (equal volumes, â‰ˆ 225 Â°C); <span class="m">Clâ‚‚ + 3Fâ‚‚ â†’ 2ClFâ‚ƒ</span> (excess Fâ‚‚); <span class="m">Brâ‚‚ + 5Fâ‚‚ â†’ 2BrFâ‚…</span>; <span class="m">Iâ‚‚ + 7Fâ‚‚ â†’ 2IFâ‚‡</span></td></tr>
