<h3 id="s11-3">11.3 Interhalogens ka structure kaise explain karte hain (VSEPR)</h3>
<div class="box why">
  <p class="bt">Why â€” shapes ka logic (ek hi method se sab nikal jaate hain)</p>
  <p>Central atom ke around electron pairs gino: <strong>bond pairs + lone pairs</strong>. Uske hisaab se geometry choose karo, phir lone pairs ki position adjust karo (lone pairs 90Â° positions se bachte hain, aur axial positions nahi lete):</p>
  <ul style="margin-bottom:0">
