<h2 class="chapter"><span class="chnum">Chapter 12 Â· Unit II</span>Chemistry of Noble Gases &amp; Xenon Compounds</h2>

<p class="lead">Poore 19th century tak chemists maante the ki noble gases "inert" hain â€” koi compound nahi banate. 1962 mein ek experiment ne ye maanyata todh di. Ye chapter wahi kahani hai: "inert" se "chemistry of xenon" tak â€” aur usmein structure/bonding ka best example bhi milta hai.</p>

<h3 id="s12-1">12.1 Noble gases â€” general properties aur "inert" hone ka reason</h3>
