<h3 id="s12-6">12.6 Structure aur bonding in xenon compounds â€” VBT, 3câ€“4e aur modern view</h3>

<div class="box def">
  <p class="bt">VBT (valence bond theory) explanation â€” expanded octet</p>
  <p>Excited Xe ke 5p electrons unpair hokar 5d orbitals mein promote ho jaate hain, aur phir <strong>spÂ³d, spÂ³dÂ² ya spÂ³dÂ³ hybridisation</strong> se bonds bante hain:</p>
