<h3 id="s13-1">13.1 Fundamental particles of the nucleus</h3>
<p>Atom ka poora mass aur poora positive charge nucleus mein concentrated hai â€” par nucleus ke andar sirf positive charge hai, to protons ek doosre ko repel karte hain. Phir bhi nucleus toota nahi? Iske peeche ek alag force hai (nuclear force) â€” aur wahi is chapter ka hero hai.</p>

