    t<sub>Â½</sub> = <span class="frac"><span>ln 2</span><span>Î»</span></span> = <span class="frac"><span>0.693</span><span>Î»</span></span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Ï„ = <span class="frac"><span>1</span><span>Î»</span></span> = <span class="frac"><span>t<sub>Â½</sub></span><span>0.693</span></span> = 1.44 t<sub>Â½</sub>
  </div>
  <p style="margin-bottom:0"><strong>Half-life:</strong> wo time jismein half nuclei decay ho jaate hain (<span class="m">N = Nâ‚€/2</span>). <strong>Average life:</strong> ek nucleus ke decay hone tak ke time ka average (Ï„). Dono mass, temperature, pressure ya chemical state par depend nahi karte â€” ye nuclear property hai.</p>
</div>

<div class="box ex">
