  <p><strong>(a)</strong> Ek radioisotope ka tÂ½ = 20 min hai. 60 min baad kitna fraction bachega?<br>
  60 min = 3 half-lives â†’ bacha fraction = (1/2)Â³ = <strong>1/8 = 12.5 %</strong>.</p>
  <p><strong>(b)</strong> Activity 1 % par pahunchne ke liye kitne half-lives?<br>
  <span class="m">(1/2)â¿ = 0.01 âŸ¹ n = log(100)/log 2 = 2/0.301 = <strong>6.64 half-lives</strong></span> âœ“</p>
  <p style="margin-bottom:0"><strong>(c)</strong> Â¹â´C ka tÂ½ = 5730 yr. Uska Î»? &nbsp;<span class="m">Î» = 0.693/5730 yr = 1.21 Ã— 10â»â´ yrâ»Â¹ = 3.84 Ã— 10â»Â¹Â² sâ»Â¹</span> âœ“</p>
