<h3 id="s2-1">2.1 Equivalence relation â€” definition aur classic examples</h3>
<div class="box def">
  <p class="bt">Definition â€” Equivalence relation</p>
  <p><strong>A relation R on a set A is an equivalence relation if it is reflexive, symmetric and transitive.</strong> (Teeno properties zaroori hain â€” ek bhi missing to equivalence nahi.)</p>
</div>
