<div class="box ex">
  <p class="bt">Worked Example 1 â€” Hasse diagram for the subsets of {x, y}</p>
  <p><span class="m">S = {x, y}</span>, to <span class="m">P(S) = {âˆ…, {x}, {y}, {x,y}}</span>. Inclusion (âŠ†) poset ka Hasse diagram banao.</p>
