    <li>Edges (cover relations): âˆ…â€“{x}, âˆ…â€“{y}, {x}â€“{x,y}, {y}â€“{x,y}. <strong>4 edges</strong>. Ye diagram ek "diamond" (à¤¹à¥€à¤°à¤¾) banata hai â€” aur yahi Mâ‚‚ lattice hai jo Ch 4 mein "distributive lattice" ka basic building block banega.</li>
