  <div class="dbody"><p class="a">6 âˆ¨ 10 = lcm(6,10) = <strong>30</strong>; 6 âˆ§ 10 = gcd(6,10) = <strong>2</strong>. Check: dono answers Dâ‚ƒâ‚€ ke elements hain âœ“ â€” isliye divisibility poset lattice hai.</p></div>
