  <ul style="margin-bottom:0">
    <li>Lattice = poset jisme <strong>har pair</strong> ka LUB (âˆ¨) aur GLB (âˆ§) usi set mein ho.</li>
    <li>Algebraic definition: âˆ§, âˆ¨ with idempotent, commutative, associative, absorption laws â€” plus duality principle.</li>
    <li>Divisibility: <span class="m">âˆ¨ = lcm</span>, <span class="m">âˆ§ = gcd</span>; power set: <span class="m">âˆª</span> aur <span class="m">âˆ©</span>.</li>
