<div class="box exam">
  <p class="bt">Exam corner â€” Chapter 4</p>
  <p><strong>Short:</strong> (i) Lattice define kijiye (dono definitions). (ii) Distributive lattice ki definition. (iii) Complement define kijiye. (iv) Dâ‚ƒâ‚€ mein 5 ka complement. (v) Kaunse do lattices "forbidden" hain distributivity ke liye?</p>
