    <li><strong>Cross-check:</strong> CNF ko simplify karo â†’ (x+y+z)(x+y+zâ€²) = x + y; (xâ€²+y+z)(xâ€²+y+zâ€²) = xâ€² + y; dono ka product = (x+y)(xâ€²+y) = y; bacha 5th factor (xâ€²+yâ€²+zâ€²). To CNF = <span class="m">y(xâ€² + yâ€² + zâ€²) = xâ€²y + yzâ€²</span> âœ“ â€” bilkul DNF jaisa! Ye sabse solid verification hai.</li>
