  <div class="dbody"><p class="a">2 variables ki 4 rows hoti hain. f = 1 sirf 3 rows par hai, matlab <strong>f = 0 sirf 1 row par</strong>. Isliye <strong>CNF bahut chhota hoga</strong> (sirf 1 maxterm!) jabki DNF mein 3 minterms lagenge. Trick: jo kam ho (1 wali rows ya 0 wali rows), usi se normal form chuno â€” kam terms = kam gates.</p></div>
</details>
