  <p style="margin-bottom:0">Dhyan do: yahan "discrete" ka matlab hai <em>alag-alag points</em> (1, 2, 3, â€¦) â€” beech mein koi value nahi, jaise aâ‚€.â‚… ka koi matlab nahi hota.</p>
</div>
