<h3 id="s10-2">10.2 Operations on discrete numeric functions</h3>
<div class="box def">
  <p class="bt">Operations (point-wise + shift)</p>
  <ul style="margin-bottom:0">
    <li><strong>Sum:</strong> <span class="m">(a + b)â‚™ = aâ‚™ + bâ‚™</span> &nbsp;Â·&nbsp; <strong>Product (point-wise):</strong> <span class="m">(a Â· b)â‚™ = aâ‚™ Â· bâ‚™</span></li>
    <li><strong>Scalar multiple:</strong> <span class="m">(c a)â‚™ = c aâ‚™</span></li>
    <li><strong>Shift (left):</strong> <span class="m">(S a)â‚™ = aâ‚™â‚Šâ‚</span> â€” poori sequence ek kadam aage khisak jaati hai.</li>
    <li><strong>Difference operator:</strong> <span class="m">(Î”a)â‚™ = aâ‚™â‚Šâ‚ âˆ’ aâ‚™</span> â€” "discrete derivative" (jaise aâ‚™ = nÂ² ke liye Î”aâ‚™ = 2n + 1).</li>
    <li><strong>Convolution (sabse important!):</strong> <span class="m">(a * b)â‚™ = Î£<sub>k=0</sub><sup>n</sup> aâ‚– bâ‚™â‚‹â‚–</span> â€” yahi "product" generating functions aur recurrence relations mein kaam aata hai.</li>
    <li><strong>Accumulation (prefix sum):</strong> <span class="m">(Î£a)â‚™ = aâ‚€ + aâ‚ + â‹¯ + aâ‚™</span>.</li>
  </ul>
</div>
<div class="box ex">
  <p class="bt">Worked Example 1 â€” operations ka quick practice</p>
  <p><span class="m">a = âŸ¨1, 2, 3, 4, â€¦âŸ©</span> (yaani aâ‚™ = n + 1) aur <span class="m">b = âŸ¨1, 1, 1, 1, â€¦âŸ©</span> (bâ‚™ = 1) lo.</p>
  <ul class="deriv">
