    <li>Point-wise product: <span class="m">aÂ·b = âŸ¨1, 2, 3, 4, â€¦âŸ© = a</span> (kyunki bâ‚™ = 1 har jagah)</li>
    <li>Shift: <span class="m">Sa = âŸ¨2, 3, 4, 5, â€¦âŸ©</span> â€” dekho, ye "sum" se same aa gaya (coincidence kyunki aâ‚™ linear hai).</li>
    <li>Difference: <span class="m">Î”a = âŸ¨1, 1, 1, 1, â€¦âŸ©</span> â€” constant function ka difference 0 hota hai</li>
