<h3 id="s10-4">10.4 Kuch zaroori facts aur applications</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Growth ka order</strong> (jo exam mein poochha jaata hai): <span class="m">1 &lt; log n &lt; âˆšn &lt; n &lt; n log n &lt; nÂ² &lt; nÂ³ &lt; 2â¿ &lt; n! &lt; nâ¿</span>.</li>
