<h2 class="chapter"><span class="chnum">Chapter 11 Â· Unit II</span>Generating Functions</h2>

<p class="lead">Generating function = <strong>sequence ko ek polynomial/series mein pack kar do</strong>. Isse counting ke mushkil sawaal algebra ke aasaan sawaal ban jaate hain, aur recurrence relations hal karna (Ch 12â€“13) mechanical ho jaata hai. Isko ek "coat hanger" samjho jis par aap poori sequence latka dete ho.</p>

<h3 id="s11-1">11.1 Definition â€” ordinary generating function (OGF)</h3>
<div class="box def">
  <p class="bt">Definition</p>
