  <p style="margin-bottom:0">Yahan <span class="m">x</span> sirf ek "bookkeeping symbol" hai â€” hum ise value nahi dete (convergence ki tension nahi), bas coefficient ki jagah pakad dete hain: <strong>aâ‚™ = xâ¿ ka coefficient</strong>. Isliye likhte hain <span class="m">aâ‚™ = [xâ¿] G(x)</span>.</p>
</div>
