<section id="ch8">
<h2 class="chapter"><span class="chnum">Chapter 8 Â· Unit I</span>Principle of Inclusion &amp; Exclusion</h2>

<p class="lead">Pigeonhole batata hai "kuch pakka hai". Inclusionâ€“Exclusion <strong>ginti</strong> karta hai â€” jab objects kai categories mein overlap karte hon, to total kitne hain. "Union ka size" nikaalne ka ye sabse bharosemand tarika hai.</p>

<h3 id="s8-1">8.1 Do sets aur teen sets ke formulas</h3>
