  <p style="margin-bottom:0">Last column mein saara T â€” isliye ye ek <strong>tautology</strong> hai. Logical reason bhi saaf hai: <span class="m">p âˆ§ q</span> sach hone ka matlab hai dono sach, aur tab <span class="m">p âˆ¨ q</span> bhi sach hoga hi. Yaani implication kabhi jhoota nahi ho sakta.</p>
</div>

